Optional FFTW provider

The off-by-default `fftw` feature uses a separately installed FFTW runtime.
FFTW is Copyright Matteo Frigo and the Massachusetts Institute of Technology
and is distributed under the GPL-2.0-or-later. Commercial licenses are available.

Tenferro neither bundles FFTW nor links to it at build time. Runtime loading
does not by itself exempt a combined work from the GPL. Evaluate FFTW's license
terms before distributing software that enables the FFTW provider.
